(SECTION: AiTC follow-up when they reply. Next step. After answering, offer a trial on a) Tj
T*
(sample exercise or on airspace they supply. Say that exercises can be previewed in the) Tj
T*
(exercise-creation module, and that artificial intelligence can pilot the aircraft so they do) Tj
T*
(not need a person at the other end. If the reply is a refusal, thank them and do not keep) Tj
T*
(following up.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION: AiTC trial. What to show. A trial shows radar and tower in the browser. It shows an) Tj
T*
(exercise created in the platform and previewed before it is run. It can show aircraft placed) Tj
T*
(by the assistant, then adjusted by hand so the conflict and the traffic peak sit where the) Tj
T*
(instructor wants them. It can show the traffic load in each sector of that exercise. It can) Tj
T*
(show a scripted replay of the session, which is stored as a script rather than as a video.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION: AiTC trial. What the organisation needs. The organisation needs a browser and the) Tj
T*
(computers it already has. It does not need a dedicated operating system and it does not need) Tj
T*
(a human pseudo-pilot for an exercise that uses artificial intelligence piloting. If they) Tj
T*
(want their own airspace, they can provide a simulator file, an aeronautical information) Tj
T*
(publication, or another file that contains the airspace information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION: AiTC pricing. Licence shapes. AiTC is offered as a per-user licence or as an) Tj
T*
(organisation licence. A per-user licence is a price for each person who uses the platform.) Tj
T*
(An organisation licence is one agreement for an academy, a university, or an air navigation) Tj
T*
(service. AGI Aeronautics states the figure in the written proposal for that organisation. Do) Tj
T*
(not put a price in an email unless that figure is in the proposal you are sending.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION: AiTC pricing. What not to say. Do not quote a network-wide contract as if it were) Tj
T*
(the price of one academy purchase. Do not state a simulator vendor, an ATM system, or a) Tj
T*
(contact email that is not in the organisation record. Do not say that a country has already) Tj
T*
(been contacted unless the correspondence for that location shows a sent message. Do not say) Tj
T*
(that a reply has been received unless the correspondence shows a received message.) Tj
T*
